cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it as below."
title: "cauchy-horizon-crossing: code and data for the cost of crossing the Cauchy horizon and the traversable window"
abstract: >-
  Reproduction package for the note "Crossing the inner horizon of a regular
  black hole: the cost of the Cauchy horizon and the passable window". Contains
  the tidal-tensor integration, the shell-impulse thresholds, the convergence
  study in the number of shells, the Reissner-Nordstrom control run, and the
  figure of the window.
type: software
